    {
      "id": "HELP_TOPIC_21",
      "topic_id": 21,
      "speaker": "Game help",
      "heading": "Market",
      "english": "The market lets you buy and sell trade goods and gather information. If you bring a [[194|Source Item]] to a city's market, you may be asked to hand it over. Doing so adds to that city's [[152|specialties]]. See [[22|Trade]], [[23|Commercial Investment]] and [[24|Market Prices]].",
      "context": "Original market/shared-command/city-data help and its linked neighbors.",
      "source_meaning": "Trade and information at the market. A source item may be requested; giving it expands local specialties. Links to Trade, Commercial Investment and Market Prices.",
      "localization_note": "Retain the request as a possibility rather than an automatic loss of the item.",
      "review": {
        "source": true,
        "context": true,
        "localization": true,
        "naturalness": true,
        "formatting": true
      },
      "clean_source_hex": "",
      "canonical_source_hex": "",
      "current_source_hex": "",
      "source_Japanese_with_link_IDs": "交易所\n交易品の売買と情報収集を行います。\n【！】「[[194|原産物]]」に属するアイテムを持って街の交易所に行くと、そのアイテムを譲ってくれるよう頼まれることがあります。アイテムを譲ると、その街の[[152|特産品]]が増えます。\n→[[22|交易]]　→[[23|商業投資]]　→[[24|相場情報]]\n\n",
      "original_links": [
        {
