    {
      "id": "HELP_TOPIC_103",
      "topic_id": 103,
      "speaker": "Game help",
      "heading": "Shared Commands",
      "english": "These commands are available both in cities and at sea. Press X on the city or sailing screen to open the menu. See [[104|Route Map]], [[105|Deck]], [[134|Info]], [[138|Items]], [[139|Assign Sailors]] and [[140|Functions]].",
      "context": "Original market/shared-command/city-data help and its linked neighbors.",
      "source_meaning": "Shared commands are usable in both city and sea screens; the source menu-button symbol opens them. Six command destinations.",
