    {
      "id": "HELP_TOPIC_127",
      "topic_id": 127,
      "speaker": "Game help",
      "heading": "Holds",
      "english": "The ship's holds are divided into five types according to their purpose. You can assign officers to the Marine Barracks and Gun Batteries. See [[128|Marine Barracks]], [[129|Gun Batteries]], [[130|Rowers' Quarters]], [[131|Supply Hold]] and [[132|Cargo Hold]].",
      "context": "Original market/shared-command/city-data help and its linked neighbors.",
      "source_meaning": "Five types of ship holds; navigators can be assigned to marine quarters and armed batteries. Preserve all five links.",
      "localization_note": "Use readable full room names while retaining the restriction to the two assignable combat spaces.",
      "review": {
        "source": true,
