      "topic_id": 144,
      "speaker": "Game help",
      "heading": "City Info",
      "english": "Select a city you have visited on the Route Map to view its information. See [[145|City or Port]], [[146|Cultural Region]], [[147|Status]], [[148|Growth]], [[149|Arms]], [[150|Market Share]] and [[152|Specialties]].",
